{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "textDocument/didOpen", "params": {"textDocument": {"uri": "untitled:c.hgn", "languageId": "hugin", "version": 1, "text": "nat : Type.\nzero : nat.\nsuc : nat -> nat.\nsize : nat -> int.\nsize zero = 0.\nsize (suc N) = size N + 1.\ndouble : nat -> nat.\ndouble zero = zero.\ndouble (suc N) = suc (suc N).\nquad : nat -> nat.\nquad N = d.\nperson : type.\nfriend : person -> person -> rel.\nsymmetric : (r : ⇑(A -> A -> rel)) -> list item.\nsymmetric R = '{ R Y X :- fr }.\n%sy\n%use \"std/reflect\".\n"}}}
